  "description": "Toss is a two-seat see saw with a brown beam, Mango Yellow seats and a tyre stop under each end. The tyres take the knock when a seat comes down, which makes the ride softer for both children. The beam is narrow, 7'11\" x 1'5\" in all, so Toss slips into a play area that is already quite full. Its safe play area is 12'11\" x 5'5\". Two children ride at a time, and keeping the rhythm going builds concentration and confidence. It belongs to the Woody series and matches the brown finish of its other pieces. The galvanised pipe and moulded seats have a 3-year warranty, with 1 year on bearings and spare parts. Tell us how many children use the area at a time and we will suggest a mix.",
